# DevPass's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-devpass-setting-api-key = A regular LLM Gateway API key from https://devpass.llmgateway.io/dashboard. Publishable keys cannot read plan usage.

## The report: the billing cycle's plan credits, the premium weekly
## allowance, and the key's own spend. Plan names, such as DevPass Pro, stay
## as DevPass names them.

# The plan line of a key without a DevPass plan.
usage-devpass-pay-as-you-go = Pay as you go
usage-devpass-api-key = API key (all time)
usage-devpass-key-usage = All-time key usage
usage-devpass-key-limit = Key spending limit
# The balance of a key without a DevPass plan: what it spent, ever.
usage-devpass-key-spend = Key usage (all time)
usage-devpass-credits = DevPass credits
usage-devpass-cycle-used = Cycle used
usage-devpass-cycle-remaining = Cycle remaining
usage-devpass-premium-weekly = Premium weekly
usage-devpass-credits-left = Plan credits left
